          </div>
          <div data-lang-block="en">
            <p>Raglex is 100% open source under MPL-2.0 with <strong>zero telemetry and zero malicious code</strong>, and every release is built transparently by GitHub Actions. Because this is an independent project without a paid Apple Developer certificate, macOS Gatekeeper displays an "unidentified developer / damaged" warning on first launch. Run the command below after moving <code>Raglex.app</code> to <code>/Applications</code> to open it — and if you have any concern about running unsigned binaries, you are completely welcome to audit and compile from source, or skip using it.</p>
          </div>
          <div data-lang-block="ja">
